Test Dataset
The repository includes a synthetic FASTQ simulator (tests/simulate_taps_srna.py) that generates small RNA reads with realistic TAPS chemistry. Known m5C positions are seeded into the templates at 60 to 90% conversion in treat, against 5 to 10% in pb_Ctrl and 1 to 3% in no-treat.
The test dataset uses 100 samples to stress-test the full pipeline at scale:
python3 tests/simulate_taps_srna.py \
--outdir ~/srnataps_sim \
--reads 1000000 \
--seed 42
This writes 100 .fastq.gz files and a samples.tsv.
# Run the test pipeline
srnataps init --outdir ~/srnataps_test --species human --fastq-dir ~/srnata
